Z||000000||CHARLIE FERGUSON||02-02-2001||04:14 PM||||HELLO, I AM NEW TO THIS SITE. I HAVE TWO 85'S,ONE GT, ONE SE, BOTH ARE V-6'S AND BOTH<BR>HAVE GREY INTERIOR. IF I WANT TO TOUCH THE LIGHT GREY AREAS, WHAT COLOR DO I USE AND WHERE DO I GET IT?||||reg||5
Z||000001||sqoach||02-02-2001||04:20 PM||||welcome to the club. i haven't done any touching up (i think that's what you mean) to my interior. i'm sure someone hear can give you the color code(s). and there were 2 shades of grey. is yours dark or light grey?<P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysig2.JPG"> ||||reg||1
